          "date": "2026-11-07 21:13:42.000000000",
          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21132 build: include umh.h for call_usermodehelper()",
        "message": "LU-21132 build: include umh.h for call_usermodehelper()\n\nLinux commit v7.3-rc2-7-gd6bfb4a05aff (\"module: Bring includes in\nlinux/kmod.h up to date\") removes linux/umh.h from linux/kmod.h.\nCallers relying on linux/module.h to include it no longer build\nbecause call_usermodehelper() and UMH_WAIT_* are undeclared.\n\nInclude linux/umh.h directly in each call_usermodehelper() caller.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Chell Laszlo <pumpkinbiscuit@proton.me>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-fable-5-1\nChange-Id: I20e108423ad3310157581d249b4429cb656022e8\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
